<div class="article-detail-page">
    <div class="article-body">
        <p>When <a href="#">buying on Lively</a>, accepted payment methods include:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Payment cards like credit and debit cards</li>
            <li>Bank transfer</li>
            <li>PayPal</li>
            <li>Stripe</li>
            <li>Affirm or Klarna (<a href="#">learn about Buy Now, Pay Later</a>)</li>
        </ul>
        <p>The payment methods available to you may depend on your device and location.</p>

        <h2>Add or edit your payment method</h2>
        <p>When you add or change a payment method, it becomes your default for future purchases, not just the current item or show. You can update your payment method anytime.</p>

        <p><strong>Note:</strong> The iOS / Android app offers more options, so the steps below focus on the app. You can also make changes from the <a href="#">Payments</a> page <a href="#">lively.com</a>.</p>

        <p><strong>From your account</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the Lively app</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Account</strong> at the bottom of the screen</li>
            <li>Select <strong>Payments &amp; Shipping</strong></li>
            <li>Tap the pencil icon next to <strong>Add Payment Method</strong></li>
            <li>Choose a payment type</li>
            <li>Add a new method or choose one you've already saved</li>
        </ol>

        <p><strong>From a show</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Tap the <strong>Wallet</strong> icon in the bottom right</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Payment</strong></li>
            <li>Choose a payment type</li>
            <li>Add a new method or choose one you've already saved</li>
        </ol>

        <p><strong>From a Buy It Now item</strong></p>
        <ol>
            <li>Tap <strong>Buy Now</strong> when viewing the item</li>
            <li>Expand <strong>Payment</strong> section</li>
            <li>Tap the <strong>pencil icon</strong></li>
            <li>Choose a payment type</li>
            <li>Add a new method or choose one you've already saved</li>
        </ol>

        <h2>Remove a payment method</h2>
        <p>You'll only be able to delete a payment method if you've added more than one.</p>
        <p><strong>To remove a payment method</strong> from your account:</p>
        <ol>
            <li>Open the Lively app</li>
            <li>Tap <strong>Account</strong> at the bottom of the screen</li>
            <li>Select <strong>Payments &amp; Shipping</strong></li>
            <li>Tap the pencil icon next to <strong>Add Payment Method</strong></li>
            <li>
                Choose a payment type:
                <ul>
                    <li><strong>Credit or debit cards:</strong> Tap <strong>Edit</strong> &gt; tap the <strong>red X</strong> next to the card you want to remove.</li>
                    <li><strong>PayPal, Stripe:</strong> Tap to manage or remove the linked account. You may be redirected to the provider to make changes.</li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ol>
        <p>Trouble removing a payment method? <a href="#">Contact Lively support</a>. We can help remove most payment options.</p>

        <h2>FAQs</h2>

        <h3>Can I change my payment method after purchase?</h3>
        <p>No. You can't change the payment method for your order, but you can update it for future purchases!</p>

        <h3>Does Lively offer gift cards?</h3>
        <p>No. Lively doesn't offer gift cards at this time.</p>

        <h3>How do I use a coupon to pay?</h3>
        <p><a href="#">How to claim and use a coupon.</a></p>

        <h3>What if my payment is going through?</h3>
        <p><a href="#">What to do if your payment fails or declines.</a></p>

